From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: add native LG AWB colour calibration and transforms

Generate six colour anchors from each sensor's nominal, low-light and
golden RGB references. Apply the two module white-balance calibration
groups, interpolate low-light anchors by lux and reproduce the factory's
sensor/ideal xy shifts and RGB/xyY transforms. Share typed coordinates
with the statistics module and consolidate generated tuning.

